=== 字符串 key 的哈希表示例 ===
插入 4 个学生后：
bucket[0]: (Bob, 88) (Charlie, 91) 
bucket[1]: (Alice, 95) 
bucket[2]: (empty)
bucket[3]: (empty)
bucket[4]: (empty)
bucket[5]: (empty)
bucket[6]: (empty)
bucket[7]: (Diana, 86) 
size = 4
bucket_count = 8
load_factor = 0.5

查找 Alice：95
更新 Alice 的分数为 99
Alice = 99

删除 Bob：success
删除后：
bucket[0]: (Charlie, 91) 
bucket[1]: (Alice, 99) 
bucket[2]: (empty)
bucket[3]: (empty)
bucket[4]: (empty)
bucket[5]: (empty)
bucket[6]: (empty)
bucket[7]: (Diana, 86) 
size = 3

继续插入更多元素，观察自动 rehash：
bucket[0]: (Charlie, 91) (Ivan, 81) 
bucket[1]: (empty)
bucket[2]: (Judy, 94) 
bucket[3]: (empty)
bucket[4]: (Eve, 77) 
bucket[5]: (empty)
bucket[6]: (empty)
bucket[7]: (Diana, 86) (Frank, 83) 
bucket[8]: (empty)
bucket[9]: (Alice, 99) (Grace, 92) 
bucket[10]: (empty)
bucket[11]: (Heidi, 89) 
bucket[12]: (empty)
bucket[13]: (empty)
bucket[14]: (empty)
bucket[15]: (empty)
size = 9
bucket_count = 16
load_factor = 0.5625

